1
00:00:00,163 --> 00:00:03,373
(Sheldon:)...but I think we may be looking
at my new Tuesday hamburger.

2
00:00:04,501 --> 00:00:07,841
(Leonard:)Your old Tuesday hamburger
will be so brokenhearted.

3
00:00:08,671 --> 00:00:09,711
(Sheldon:)Way ahead of you.

4
00:00:09,881 --> 00:00:14,431
(Sheldon:)I was thinking of moving Big Boy to
Thursdays and just dropping Souplantation.

5
00:00:15,178 --> 00:00:16,428
- Really?
- Yeah.

6
00:00:16,596 --> 00:00:19,846
(Sheldon:)The name always confused me, anyway.
Souplantation.

7
00:00:20,016 --> 00:00:21,846
(Sheldon:)You can't grow soup.

8
00:00:24,771 --> 00:00:27,771
- So how's everything?
- Terrific.

9
00:00:28,233 --> 00:00:31,943
You'll be happy to know I plan to come
every Tuesday for the foreseeable future.

10
00:00:32,112 --> 00:00:35,032
Really? Oh, yay. Heh.

11
00:00:35,824 --> 00:00:38,704
(Sheldon:)Who do I speak to about
permanently reserving this table?

12
00:00:39,452 --> 00:00:42,202
(Penny:)I don't know, a psychiatrist?

13
00:00:43,581 --> 00:00:45,041
PENNY:
So, hey.

14
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:48,590
- How are things with you and Leslie?
- Oh.

15
00:00:48,753 --> 00:00:51,463
(Leonard:)To be honest,
I don't think it's going to work out.

16
00:00:52,757 --> 00:00:55,507
(Penny:)Oh, that's too bad.
Well, hey, don't worry.

17
00:00:55,677 --> 00:00:59,137
I'm sure there's someone out there
who's just right for you.

18
00:01:02,225 --> 00:01:04,645
(Leonard:)Well, what did she mean by that?

19
00:01:05,019 --> 00:01:09,229
(Leonard:)Was that just a generic platitude
or was that a subtle bid for attention?

20
00:01:11,234 --> 00:01:14,654
(Sheldon:)You know why this hamburger
surpasses the Big Boy?

21
00:01:14,988 --> 00:01:17,988
This is a single-decker,
whereas the Big Boy is a double-decker.

22
00:01:18,158 --> 00:01:22,248
(Sheldon:)This has a much more satisfying
meat-to-bun-to-condiment ratio.

23
00:01:22,996 --> 00:01:25,586
- Are you even listening to me?
- Of course I'm listening.

24
00:01:25,748 --> 00:01:29,418
(Sheldon:)Blah, blah, hopeless Penny delusion,
blah, blah, blah.

25
00:01:31,254 --> 00:01:33,044
(Leonard:)Okay, then.

26
00:01:34,632 --> 00:01:37,762
(Leonard:)You know, you can grow
the ingredients for soup.

